an","0",{"children":"Majority of 2025 revenue from international markets"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"China AI chatbot total MAU"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"700+ million"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Across all major platforms combined"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Daily token consumption (China)"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"140 trillion"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"1,000× increase in two years"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","6",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Xiaohongshu AI-related views"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"1.48 billion weekly"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"AI digital humans, thesis writing, interview coaching combined"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","7",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Enterprise clients (MiniMax)"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"214,000"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"B2B penetration alongside consumer growth"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p","28",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"These numbers tell a story that doesn't fit neatly into the Western AI narrative. While US companies measure success in ARR and enterprise seats, Chinese AI companies are measuring it in DAU, token volume, and cultural penetration. The business models differ. The user behaviors differ. But the scale is undeniable."}]]}],["$","blockquote","32",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"The West measures AI success by how many Fortune 500 companies adopt it. China measures it by how many grandmothers use it to write family recipes. Both are valid. Only one has reached a billion users.\""}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"— Chinese tech analyst, Zhihu"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","33",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","35",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Numbers Nobody Talks About: China's AI Consumer Market at a Glance"}]]}],["$","p","37",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"When Western publications cover Chinese AI, the stories are almost always about models — DeepSeek's latest benchmark, Kimi's new context window, Qwen's multilingual capabilities. What they rarely cover is the application layer: the consumer-facing products that have turned AI from a developer tool into a daily habit for hundreds of millions of people."}]]}],["$","p","39",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The gap in coverage isn't accidental. Western journalists can't easily download Doubao or Starlight (MiniMax's domestic companion app) without a Chinese phone number. The apps don't appear in US App Store rankings. The press releases are in Mandarin. And perhaps most importantly, the success of these apps doesn't fit the Western narrative about Chinese technology — which tends to focus on either cheap manufacturing or authoritarian surveillance, rarely on consumer product innovation."}]]}],["$","p","41",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"But the data tells a different story. Let's look at the competitive landscape:"}]]}],["$","div","53",{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","margin":"24px 0"},"children":["$","table",null,{"style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","fontSize":"14px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Platform"}]]}],["$","th","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Company"}]]}],["$","th","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Est. MAU (2026)"}]]}],["$","th","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","