her platforms"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"~20 trillion"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Various"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Mixed"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","7",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Total"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"~140 trillion"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"—"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"—"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p","184",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*Sources: Company disclosures, industry estimates, TokenDance analytics. Figures approximate.*"}]]}],["$","p","186",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The economics of this token consumption are fascinating. Two years ago, in early 2024, China's total daily AI token consumption was measured in the hundreds of billions. The 1,000-fold increase in 24 months represents not just user growth but usage depth — users are having longer conversations, processing larger documents, and running more complex agent workflows."}]]}],["$","p","188",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This explosion has created what some analysts call \"China's AI inflation crisis.\" Cloud providers have raised prices by 5% to 463% depending on the region and chip availability. API providers, even DeepSeek with its famously aggressive pricing, have had to recalibrate their free tiers. And the scarcity of NVIDIA H20 chips — the sanctioned-but-still-available GPUs that power most Chinese AI inference — has created a secondary market where compute capacity trades at premiums."}]]}],["$","p","190",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Yet despite these pressures, the consumer apps keep growing. Why? Because Chinese AI companies have become extraordinarily efficient at inference optimization. DeepSeek's V4 model, built on a Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) architecture, activates only 37 billion of its 1.2 trillion parameters per forward pass — achieving performance competitive with GPT-5.5 at a fraction of the inference cost. MiniMax's abab 6.5 uses similar efficiency tricks. And ByteDance, with its custom Seed chip development, is moving toward vertical integration that could eliminate GPU dependency entirely."}]]}],["$","blockquote","195",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"GitHub comment (on DeepSeek V4 inference optimization):"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"ds4.c is going to be the most important C file in AI history. If you can run DeepSeek V4-Pro on a single MacBook Pro with 20GB RAM, the entire inference economics change. China's not just winning on model quality — they're winning on delivery cost.\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"ds4.c is going to be the most important C file in AI history. If you can run DeepSeek V4-Pro on a single MacBook Pro with 20GB RAM, the entire inference economics change. China's not just winning on model quality — they're winning on delivery cost.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","196",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","198",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Global Comparison: China's Consumer AI vs. the West"}]]}],["$","p","200",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"To understand why China's consumer AI story matters globally, we need to compare apples to apples. The Western AI conversation is dominated by ChatGPT (est. 200M+ MAU globally), Claude, and Gemini — but these are primarily productivity tools for English-speaking professionals. China's ecosystem serves a different audience with different needs."}]]}],["$","div","214",{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","margin":"24px 0"},"children":["$","table",null,{"style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","fontSize":"14px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Dimension"}]]}],["$","th","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"China AI Consumer Apps"}]]}],["$","th","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Western AI Consumer Apps"}]]}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Total MAU"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"700+ million (domestic)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"~300 million (ChatGPT global)"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"DAU/MAU ratio"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Higher (habit-forming, daily use)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Lower (task-oriented, intermittent)"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Primary use cases"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Content creation, companionship, education, e-commerce"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Writing, coding, research, analysis"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Demographics"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Mass market, all ages, all tiers"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Urban professionals, English-speaking"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Revenue model"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Virtual goods, freemium, ads, enterprise"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Subscription (mostly), API"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Price sensitivity"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Very high (expects free baseline)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Moderate (accepts $20/month)"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","6",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Integration depth"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Deep (super-app model, multiple functions)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Shallow (single-purpose chat)"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","7",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Regulatory environment"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Active (content moderation, licensing)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Reactive (still debating frameworks)"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","8",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Global reach"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Growing (MiniMax, others expanding)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Dominant (OpenAI, Google global)"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","9",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Key differentiator"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Cultural adaptation, mobile-first"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Model capability, brand recognition"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p","215",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"This comparison isn't about declaring a winner. It's about recognizing that \"AI adoption\" means fundamentally different things in different markets. A Chinese grandmother using Doubao to generate a birthday video for her grandson and a San Francisco developer using Claude to debug Python are both \"AI users,\" but their needs, behaviors, and economic value to the platforms are entirely different."}]]}],["$","p","217",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"What China's consumer AI ecosystem demonstrates is that AI's mass-market potential is far larger than the Western SaaS-model approach has captured. When AI is free, fun, and embedded in the apps people already use daily, adoption curves look very different from the gradual enterprise rollout that characterizes Western deployment."}]]}],["$","blockquote","222",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Twitter/X comment:"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"The West built AI as a tool. China built AI as entertainment. Both are valid, but only one scales to a billion users. When your AI product is as engaging as TikTok, you don't need enterprise sales teams.\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"The West built AI as a tool. China built AI as entertainment. Both are valid, but only one scales to a billion users. When your AI product is as engaging as TikTok, you don't need enterprise sales teams.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","223",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","225",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"What This Means for Global Tech"}]]}],["$","p","227",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The implications of China's consumer AI empire extend far beyond market sizing exercises. They suggest several structural shifts in the global technology landscape:"}]]}],["$","p","229",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"1. The center of AI product innovation is shifting east."}]]}],["$","p","231",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"For decades, \"global\" tech products were built in Silicon Valley and adapted for other markets. The assumption was that the best engineers, the most advanced research, and the most sophisticated product thinking were concentrated in the Bay Area. China's consumer AI ecosystem challenges that assumption. Products like Doubao and Talkie weren't copies of Western apps — they were built for Chinese user behaviors first, and in several cases (particularly AI companions and digital humans) they're now being exported to Western markets."}]]}],["$","p","233",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"2. Revenue models are diverging."}]]}],["$","p","235",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Western AI industry has largely settled on a subscription-plus-API model: $20/month for consumers, per-token pricing for developers. China's ecosystem is far more diverse — virtual goods, advertising, e-commerce commissions, enterprise licensing, and freemium tiers all coexist. This diversity may prove more resilient as the industry matures and price competition intensifies."}]]}],["$","p","237",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"3. Distribution matters more than model capability."}]]}],["$","p","239",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"DeepSeek V4 may benchmark competitively with GPT-5.5, but Doubao's 100M DAU isn't driven by model quality — it's driven by the fact that Doubao appears in Douyin, on hundreds of millions of phones, and in every ByteDance product ecosystem touchpoint. In consumer AI, distribution and habit formation often trump raw capability. The best model that no one uses is economically irrelevant."}]]}],["$","p","241",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"4. The global expansion story is just beginning."}]]}],["$","p","243",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"MiniMax's 73% overseas revenue share is a leading indicator. As Chinese AI companies seek growth beyond a domestic market that's increasingly saturated and regulated, international markets — particularly Southeast Asia, the Middle East, Africa, and Latin America — represent massive opportunities. These are regions where Chinese mobile apps (TikTok, Temu, CapCut) have already built distribution relationships and user trust. Adding AI layers to those relationships is a natural next step."}]]}],["$","img","245",{"src":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510915228340-29c85a43dcfe?w=1200&h=600&fit=crop","alt":"Cybersecurity digital shield","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":"12px","margin":"24px 0"}}],["$","p","246",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*The global AI landscape is being redrawn — not by geopolitical decree, but by billions of daily user choices. Image: Unsplash*"}]]}],["$","hr","248",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","250",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Road Ahead: From Consumer Apps to AI Infrastructure"}]]}],["$","p","252",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"If 2025–2026 is the era of China's AI consumer explosion, 2026–2027 may be the era of consolidation and infrastructure. Several converging trends suggest the next phase:"}]]}],["$","p","254",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Monetization pressure is intensifying."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" Doubao's shift to paid tiers, Kimi's persistent push toward enterprise revenue, and MiniMax's IPO filing all signal that the \"growth at all costs\" phase is ending. Consumer AI companies must now demonstrate unit economics that satisfy investors — especially those considering Hong Kong or overseas listings."}]]}],["$","p","256",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Regulatory frameworks are tightening."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" China's AI regulations — from the draft \"Artificial Intelligence Law\" to the GB/Z 177 terminal intelligence standards — are creating compliance costs that favor larger platforms with dedicated legal and policy teams. Smaller AI apps may face consolidation pressure."}]]}],["$","p","258",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"The infrastructure layer is catching up."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" Companies like InfiniGence AI (which raised $700M+ for AI infrastructure) and Wuwenxinqiou ($100M+ for AI-native infrastructure) are building the compute, networking, and middleware layers that will make the next generation of consumer AI cheaper and more capable. As inference costs decline, new use cases become economically viable."}]]}],["$","p","260",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Global competition is escalating."}],["$","span","1",{"children":" As Chinese AI apps expand internationally, they'll face direct competition with Western counterparts — not just in capability, but in trust, data privacy perceptions, and geopolitical sensitivity. The success of TikTok and the controversies surrounding it offer a preview of the challenges ahead."}]]}],["$","div","270",{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","margin":"24px 0"},"children":["$","table",null,{"style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","fontSize":"14px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Trend"}]]}],["$","th","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"2025 Status"}]]}],["$","th","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"2026 Projection"}]]}],["$","th","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"2027 Outlook"}]]}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Doubao MAU"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"~200M"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"250–300M"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Stabilization or slight decline as market matures"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"MiniMax IPO"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Filed (HK)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Completed"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"International secondary listing possible"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"AI digital humans"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"410M views (Xiaohongshu)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Mainstream commerce tool"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Regulatory framework expected"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Token consumption"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"140T/day"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"200–250T/day"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Growth slows as efficiency improves"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Paid conversion rate"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"<5% (industry avg)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"8–12%"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"15–20% as free tiers tighten"}]]}]]}],["$","tr","5",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Overseas revenue (top apps)"}]]}],["$","td","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"~30% (weighted avg)"}]]}],["$","td","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"40–50%"}]]}],["$","td","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"50–60% as domestic saturates"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],["$","hr","271",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","273",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Conclusion: The Empire That Built Itself"}]]}],["$","p","275",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"China's AI consumer apps didn't conquer 2.5 billion users through a single breakthrough moment or a killer feature. They did it through a thousand incremental improvements, relentless product iteration, aggressive distribution, and a deep understanding of what everyday users actually want from AI — not what technologists think they should want."}]]}],["$","p","277",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The empire was built in plain sight, if anyone had been looking. But the language barrier, the app store geography, and the Western tech media's focus on model benchmarks rather than user metrics meant that this revolution happened largely unnoticed by the global audience that follows AI most closely."}]]}],["$","p","279",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"That is now changing. MiniMax's IPO filing — with its 2.36 billion user number splashed across international financial pages — is a wake-up call. Doubao's 100 million DAU, confirmed by multiple tracking services, is a number that demands attention. And the 140 trillion daily tokens flowing through China's AI infrastructure represent an economic force that no analysis of the global AI industry can ignore."}]]}],["$","p","281",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The story of China's AI consumer empire isn't a threat narrative or a triumphalist claim. It's a reminder that AI's global impact will be shaped by how billions of ordinary people integrate it into their daily lives — and that the companies best positioned to enable that integration may not be the ones with the highest benchmark scores, but the ones with the deepest understanding of human habits, aspirations, and the sheer creative potential of a technology that finally speaks everyone's language."}]]}],["$","hr","283",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","285",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Related Articles"}]]}],["$","p","287",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/china-ai-agent-explosion-2025-enterprise-deployment/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee","textDecoration":"underline"},"children":"China's AI Agent Explosion: How 126 Platforms and $1B+ in Enterprise Deals Are Reshaping Global Automation"}]]}],["$","p","288",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/doubao-charging-ai-free-era-ends-china-2026/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee","textDecoration":"underline"},"children":"Doubao Starts Charging: How China's Biggest AI App Ended the Free Era"}]]}],["$","p","289",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/minimax-ipo-212-million-users-ai-companion-empire/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee","textDecoration":"underline"},"children":"MiniMax Files for IPO: How China's AI Companion Empire Built 212 Million Users"}]]}],["$","p","290",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/china-ai-global-surge-api-traffic-empire-2026/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee","textDecoration":"underline"},"children":"From Made in China to Trained in China: How Chinese AI Conquered Global Developers"}]]}],["$","p","291",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"- "}],["$","a","1",{"href":"/blog/china-ai-global-surge-api-traffic-empire-2026/","style":{"color":"#22d3ee","textDecoration":"underline"},"children":"China's AI Revolution: 140 Trillion Tokens, DeepSeek V4 on Huawei, and the $700B Arms Race"}]]}],["$","hr","293",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","p","295",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*Published: May 13, 2026*"}]]}],["$","p","297",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*Author: Meeeeed — Editor at AI in China. Tracking Chinese AI companies, consumer adoption trends, and the technologies reshaping how billions of people interact with intelligent systems.*"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"marginTop":"48px","padding":"24px","backgroundColor":"#111","border":"1px solid #1a1a1a","border